+# Attribution
+
+Netie FreeIDE is a modified distribution of anomalyco/opencode
+(https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode), pinned at commit 907b3bc518.
+
+Upstream license: MIT. LICENSE is included unmodified, with every
+upstream copyright line, and so is any NOTICE file.
+
+- Copyright (c) 2025 opencode
+
+Not affiliated with or endorsed by the upstream authors. Upstream names and
+logos belong to their owners.
+
+## Changed in stage 1
+
+- Display name OpenCode rewritten to FreeIDE in prose docs only.
+- This file and a README banner added.
+
+## Not done yet (stage 2)
+
+- Package names, binaries, identifiers and UI strings are still upstream's.
+- SECURITY, SUPPORT and CONTRIBUTING contacts and URLs still point at upstream.
+- Translated docs, changelogs and third-party notices are untouched.
+- Netie gate wiring: Provider base URL -> OpenVault /v1. Shell, edit and fetch tools -> Cortex tool_runner and OpenVault POST /api/crew/gate.
